#adm/daemons/mailmesg.c
remain ({"vincent",})
mesg "Hi :	I am so glad that you finish the quest. Well, in fact, I do have some	suggestions to the quest. But since you've become the sage of	monk, I think the QC of the quest must pass, right? I don't know	who did the QC, but it doesn't matter. The process to find the book	is a little bit easier, I think. So maybe you can change 	it to be somewhat difficult, I mean more complicated.	Anyway, thanks for your efforts and hope you can keep on improving	the monk guild. :)  Bcz I am in the army now and the situation is 	in emergency, I can't login very often. If you do some change to	the monk guild, plz mail me to let me know about it, ok? 	Congraz to you and happy mudding !!!						almuhara"
